msgctxt "96"
msgid "You win! You're as strong as I thought you were."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "You're quite the impressive fighter yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"Hahaha... Hearing that from you makes the sting of defeat a little less "
"painful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "I guess my training didn't go to waste after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"You don't need your fists anymore. Your sushi should be enough to protect "
"your father's restaurant. You'll be all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Heh, thanks. You've got a way with words, you know. I feel a little better "
"now, thanks to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Guess I'd better get back to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "If you'll excuse me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Fighting him dredged up memories of one of the Komaki techniques I used to "
"know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"You can now use <Color:9>Komaki Knock Back<Color:Default>. Guard as the "
"enemy attacks, and immediately press <Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> to "
"parry the attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Well, I'd better find the next student."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"I've defeated all of the old man's pupils. I'd better get back to the Komaki"
" Dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Well, it looks like I won that one. Feel free to come back at any time. I'll"
" take you on whenever you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "(I lost. I should try fighting him again sometime.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Here should be good enough. Right then, let's get started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Why did you quit Komaki's dojo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"I came to train in a Tokyo sushi restaurant to help my father get out of "
"debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "But you know how things can be in a city like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"You have to do whatever you can to survive. In the end, my hands were most "
"often used to hurt people, not to make delicious sushi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"I heard about Komaki style fighting at the gambling hall. The moment I did, "
"I forgot all about my training as a sushi chef."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"But when I met the owner of the place I'm working at now, I remembered how I"
" used to feel about everything... about sushi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"I want to make the best sushi in the world and help my father keep his "
"restaurant afloat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "That's why I quit Master Komaki's dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Still, I liked that dojo. I knew I could get stronger there. I've always "
"wanted to be strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"All right, then, Kiryu-san. Let's see how my Komaki training fares against a"
" real opponent! Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6276"
msgid "Sushi Bar Worker"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6280"
msgid "Talk_No"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6284"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6288"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6292"
msgid "Talk_Sorry"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6296"
